  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>此整合包用於 YouTube 上的 AeroAQ 影片，包含《咒術迴戰：詛咒命運》模組以及一些擴充套件和多個地牢與效能模組。</strong><br><br><strong>透過此整合包，您可以在 Minecraft 中體驗《咒術迴戰》的世界，並嘗試各種不同的咒術。此外，還有多個地形結構模組將為您的遊玩體驗增添驚險刺激的元素。我們也加入了數個生活品質優化模組，例如 ToroHealth 可讓您查看其他玩家或生物的生命值，FTB Essentials 和 Teams 則支援 tpa 傳送給好友或 rtp 隨機傳送功能，讓探索過程更加快速有趣。</strong><br><br><strong>祝您遊玩愉快！</strong><br><br>模組清單：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursed-fate-antigravity-system\" rel=\"nofollow\">詛咒命運：反重力系統（by Igor_Roslon）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin（by squeek502）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/embeddium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embeddium（by FiniteReality）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-library-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Library (NeoForge)（by FTB）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/announce-message\" rel=\"nofollow\">Announce Message（by Aero_AQ）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API（by shedaniel）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-health-bar-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Health Bar For Forge（by Aero_AQ）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iceberg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iceberg [Neo/Forge]（by Grend_G）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/disaster-plants-cursed-fate-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">災難植物 - 詛咒命運擴充（by StellaPlaysMinecraftTooMuch）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\">MmmMmmMmmMmm（目標假人）（by MehVahdJukaar）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/controlling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Controlling（by Jaredlll08）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursed-fate-black-bird-manipulation\" rel=\"nofollow\">詛咒命運：黑鳥操控（by Igor_Roslon）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cf-ratio-technique\" rel=\"nofollow\">CF-比例技術擴充（by VBro170）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursed-fate-technique-extinguishment\" rel=\"nofollow\">詛咒命運：術式熄滅（by Igor_Roslon）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/repurposed-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures（Neoforge/Forge）（by telepathicgrunt）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-admin-utilities\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Admin Utilities（by Aero_AQ）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/balm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Balm（by BlayTheNinth）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursed-fate\" rel=\"nofollow\">咒術迴戰：詛咒命運（by imnothuragan）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/worldedit\" rel=\"nofollow\">WorldEdit（by sk89q）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kleiders-custom-renderer-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kleiders Custom Renderer API（by kleiders3010）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waystones（by BlayTheNinth）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grant-commands\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grant Commands（by Aero_AQ）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/natures-compass\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nature's Compass（by Chaosyr）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/comedian-cursed-fate-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">喜劇演員 - 詛咒命運擴充（by StellaPlaysMinecraftTooMuch）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks（by YaLTeR）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib（by Gecko）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mod