-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">詛咒命運：禪院真依擴充（by siah_si）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-formation-cursed-fate-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰結 - 詛咒命運擴充（by Jellyton）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cursed-speech-cursed-fate-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">詛咒言靈 - 詛咒命運擴充（by StellaPlaysMinecraftTooMuch）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malice-and-light-cursed-fate-addon-dabura\" rel=\"nofollow\">惡意與光 - 詛咒命運擴充（大魔）（by StellaPlaysMinecraftTooMuch）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Teams (NeoForge)（by FTB）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise - Forge!（by Aureljz）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entityculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Culling Fabric/Forge（by tr7zw）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ibe-editor\" rel=\"nofollow\">IBE Editor（by skyecodes）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions（by DarkhaxDev）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/photon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Photon（by KilaBash）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kashimo-mythical-beast-amber-cursed-fate-addon\" rel=\"nofollow\">樫木（神獸琥珀）詛咒命運擴充（by Wagyubleh）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/searchables\" rel=\"nofollow\">Searchables（by Jaredlll08）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harmony-and-chaos-cursed-fate-addon-marulu-val-vol\" rel=\"nofollow\">和諧與混沌 - 詛咒命運擴充（瑪魯魯·瓦爾·沃爾·耶爾沃里）（by StellaPlaysMinecraftTooMuch）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oculus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oculus（by Asek3）</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-home\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better /home（by Aero_AQ）</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>所有榮譽歸屬於原創作者</p>",
